  "ingredients": [
    "1 (16 ounce) package medium-wide egg noodles",
    "1 cup butter, divided",
    "2 large onions, chopped",
    "2 small heads cabbage, cored and cut into 1-inch pieces",
    "salt and ground black pepper to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 300 degrees F (150 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Zuuh3hzDzRLp-BxeH-XsxoA1pg0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-220716-haluski-cabbage-and-noodles-ddmfs-4x3-ingredients-a3c3a7d1dacb42ac8086bc3803da8cf6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/220716/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fill a large pot with lightly salted water and bring to a rolling boil. Stir in egg noodles and return to a boil.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/sLykqRqSIqNFCZ-XmfZGODszw-A=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-220716-haluski-cabbage-and-noodles-ddmfs-4x3-step-01-1cc8ff8e55eb4b899fbdbf68954c553f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/220716/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook noodles uncovered, stirring occasionally, until tender but slightly firm, about 5 minutes. Drain well and set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/IGSUuwJ5KcG09cNxpwDPlQAn1Cg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-220716-haluski-cabbage-and-noodles-ddmfs-4x3-step-02-6708ba48407e46fe8a6185015ea69d19.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/220716/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Melt 1/2 cup butter in a large skillet over medium-low heat. Add onions; cook and stir until translucent, 5 to 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/tM5s2X_agRT7LOkkcyB6KdzJ1cs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-220716-haluski-cabbage-and-noodles-ddmfs-4x3-step-03-090f4a525ad549dd9caad19be428ad27.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/220716/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add cabbage and remaining 1/2 cup butter to onions; cook and stir until cabbage is softened but not browned, 5 to 8 minutes. Season with salt and black pepper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/NAP-9ToBmq6FhInpF3i7CZs-uxU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-220716-haluski-cabbage-and-noodles-ddmfs-4x3-step-04-4b92c8ef61254a3db42a423044f69e81.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/220716/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place cooked noodles and cabbage mixture in a large roasting pan; stir gently to combine. Sprinkle with more salt and black pepper, if desired.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/hsSRrkOE49NMHizq6Us3bnMjT1E=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-220716-haluski-cabbage-and-noodles-ddmfs-4x3-step-05-3e92960cef8f42ab9a920ceff7256b53.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/220716/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until golden brown on top, 30 to 40 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/O-_2OINBaoupReu7fU8AOhjGGr4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/220716-haluski-cabbage-and-noodles-ddmfs-4x3-hero-1654d0e423d84f4283b1d3e105c489f9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/220716/step_07.webp"
    }
